<div class="finals-blurb">
  <h2>How the finals work</h2>
  <p>After the 6 weeks of games, every team is ranked by where it finishes in the table. The 12 teams then split into <strong>three groups of 4</strong>:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Cup:</strong> 1st to 4th</li>
    <li><strong>Plate:</strong> 5th to 8th</li>
    <li><strong>Bowl:</strong> 9th to 12th</li>
  </ul>
  <p>On finals night each group plays its own little tournament: two <strong>semi-finals</strong> (1st v 4th and 2nd v 3rd in the group), then the two winners meet in the <strong>Grand Final</strong>. Every group crowns its own champion, so every team is playing for something.</p>
</div>
